## Context

Child of 0029 (tracker). Ruling 10 of 2026-09-06: an agent builds library and
bank in one shot; review rounds against checklists find what is missing;
checklists and reviews, no automatic guard. Part D items 12 and 13 (minimum
cell occupancy; a red state per MUST cell on broken builds) are review-round
checks under that ruling.

## Actions
1. A decorrelated reviewer reads the bank and the recipe against 0029's
   coverage ledger (its exit criteria), the tally rows, the lane pairs
   (question language x answer-paragraph language, with R7 and R29 naming
   which bind) and the census marginals of `verification/LIBRARY-CENSUS-0029.md`.
2. Every gap is listed with its reason; a second round fills what it can;
   the rest is reported plainly as a gap.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] the gap list recorded in this ticket's body and in the tracker
- [ ] second-round fills committed on the build branches
